===============================================================================
ASTRA
===============================================================================

MITIM's ASTRA interface (src/mitim_tools/astra_tools/) drives the ASTRA
transport code (G. Pereverzev, P. N. Yushmanov), which is distributed by
IPP Garching at https://gitlab.mpcdf.mpg.de/git/astra.git. ASTRA sources are
NOT redistributed with MITIM; users must obtain their own copy and point
MITIM at it via the ASTRA_REPO environment variable.
